{"id":"cb253f0f4147f5a8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-borel-cantelli.md","title":"第一Borel–Cantelli引理","display":"thm-borel-cantelli — 第一Borel–Cantelli引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-borel-cantelli","aliases":["43-thm-borel-cantelli"],"display":"thm-borel-cantelli — 第一Borel–Cantelli引理","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 4.2.1, print p.4 / PDF p.24","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-borel-cantelli"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-borel-cantelli</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-borel-cantelli — 第一Borel–Cantelli引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 4.2.1, print p.4 / PDF p.24"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 为公平硬币概率测度。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\mu(C_n)&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow\\mu\\left(\\bigcap_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\n\\ge m}}C_n\\right)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\mu(C_n)&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow\\mu\\left(\\bigcap_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\n\\ge m}}C_n\\right)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个尾并覆盖上极限，其测度不超过相应尾和，而尾和趋于0。无需独立性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.2.1, print p.4 / PDF p.24。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-cylinder]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\mu(C_n)<\\infty\\Rightarrow\\mu\\left(\\bigcap_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\bigcup_{\\substack{n\\in\\mathbb N\\\\n\\ge m}}C_n\\right)=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1055,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-borel-cantelli]] — 第一Borel–Cantelli引理"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}